36
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:35,440
So I took these solutions from
the reference solutions that

37
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:37,800
exist for this exam, but
you would want your LLM

38
00:01:37,800 --> 00:01:40,600
to be capable enough
to, one, write

39
00:01:40,600 --> 00:01:43,100
