00:07:31,410 --> 00:07:33,770
on some form of imitation
learning, which I'm guessing

182
00:07:33,770 --> 00:07:35,020
has been covered in the class.

183
00:07:35,020 --> 00:07:36,562
We'll talk about
some techniques that

184
00:07:36,562 --> 00:07:38,490
look like offline
reinforcement learning,

185
00:07:38,490 --> 00:07:39,948
and I'll talk about
some techniques

186
00:07:39,948 --> 00:07:42,170
that look like online
reinforcement learning.

187
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:45,450
This is my characterization
