188
00:07:45,450 --> 00:07:47,210
In general, there's
a lot of literature

189
00:07:47,210 --> 00:07:48,730
that has been coming
out, so I'll probably

190
00:07:48,730 --> 00:07:49,850
miss out on some
of them, but this

191
00:07:49,850 --> 00:07:51,600
