335
00:13:52,770 --> 00:13:54,250
So there's three
axes we're going

336
00:13:54,250 --> 00:13:57,130
to look at when we
think about training

337
00:13:57,130 --> 00:13:59,890
these methods on this data.

338
00:13:59,890 --> 00:14:03,930
We can train them with
