339
00:14:03,930 --> 00:14:05,470
on multiple questions.

340
00:14:05,470 --> 00:14:08,127
So we can take this data set
of problems and solutions

341
00:14:08,127 --> 00:14:10,210
and train the model to
produce the solution, given

342
00:14:10,210 --> 00:14:12,810
the question, like, what
