420
00:18:20,880 --> 00:18:23,120
up there where what
you're doing now

421
00:18:23,120 --> 00:18:25,440
is you're going to
produce many solutions

422
00:18:25,440 --> 00:18:29,840
and try to filter for correct
ones and train on them again.

423
00:18:29,840 --> 00:18:31,760
What happens now
