431
00:18:50,530 --> 00:18:52,030
which ended up being correct.

432
00:18:52,030 --> 00:18:54,270
So these are on-policy
rollouts that

433
00:18:54,270 --> 00:18:55,737
are sampled from your policy.

434
00:18:55,737 --> 00:18:57,570
And you're simply
filtering for correctness,

435
00:18:57,570 --> 00:19:00,112
which you can because you know
