00:19:09,110 --> 00:19:10,850
high-quality or high-rewarding.

442
00:19:10,850 --> 00:19:12,017
You talked about offline RL.

443
00:19:12,017 --> 00:19:13,017
That's on your homework.

444
00:19:13,017 --> 00:19:14,490
You can learn from
