447
00:19:19,310 --> 00:19:21,390
of these methods
as methods which

448
00:19:21,390 --> 00:19:23,550
train on incorrect
solutions or learn

449
00:19:23,550 --> 00:19:25,930
from traces or rollouts
that did not succeed,

450
00:19:25,930 --> 00:19:27,390
that attained a reward of 0.

451
00:19:27,390 --> 00:19:29,305
So I'm just going
to call them RL.

452
00:19:29,305 --> 00:19:31,430
So there are these three
different axis along which

453
00:19:31,430 --> 00:19:33,410
