00:21:40,680 --> 00:21:42,180
So the model has
some capability now

510
00:21:42,180 --> 00:21:44,013
to produce some answers
for those questions,

511
00:21:44,013 --> 00:21:45,620
and then you'll start doing it.

512
00:21:45,620 --> 00:21:48,340
Great, so this was
actually one of the slides

