00:22:28,320 --> 00:22:32,050
So what we tried to do
in this particular slide

531
00:22:32,050 --> 00:22:35,107
is we are trying to see
how well SFT behaves

532
00:22:35,107 --> 00:22:36,690
and comparing it
to-- and we're trying

