561
00:23:43,515 --> 00:23:45,890
Ideally, you would want this
exponent to be really large,

562
00:23:45,890 --> 00:23:48,135
like, D to the minus
1/2, for instance,

563
00:23:48,135 --> 00:23:50,010
because this curve will
go down very quickly.

564
00:23:50,010 --> 00:23:51,590
And with a reasonable
