having a different policy

956
00:39:41,150 --> 00:39:42,918
because that makes sense also.

957
00:39:42,918 --> 00:39:45,210
But I think there's a part
of the community, especially

958
00:39:45,210 --> 00:39:48,730
the NLP community, which
does it using the same policy

