966
00:40:05,490 --> 00:40:07,490
angle in my slides
because I think it would

967
00:40:07,490 --> 00:40:09,330
have been a bit too technical.

968
00:40:09,330 --> 00:40:12,070
But yeah, if you check the
paper, you will find exactly.

969
00:40:12,070 --> 00:40:14,370
It talks about stitching
in this particular setting,

970
00:40:14,370 --> 00:40:15,910
and it's very related concepts.

971
00:40:15,910 --> 00:40:18,050
So yeah, think of it that way.

972
00:40:18,050 --> 00:40:19,010
OK, great.

973
00:40:19,010 --> 00:40:21,030
So this is the definition
of a Q function.

974
00:40:21,030 --> 00:40:24,190
And once you've defined
this Q function,

975
00:40:24,190 --> 00:40:27,250
it turns out that you can use
this Q function to now tell you

