1438
00:59:48,150 --> 00:59:52,910
fewer samples than training
with SFT on human written data.

1439
00:59:52,910 --> 00:59:55,412
RFP was 2x for recollection.

1440
00:59:55,412 --> 00:59:56,870
I removed that line
here because it

1441
00:59:56,870 --> 00:59:58,470
